**\[PLATFORM NAME\]**

Construction Management Platform

**DATA MODEL & SCHEMA OVERVIEW**

*Document 4 of 9 \| Version 1.0 \| Confidential*

March 2026

FOR ENGINEERING & TECHNICAL LEADERSHIP --- CONFIDENTIAL

**Table of Contents**

**1. Overview & Conventions**

This document defines the complete database schema for \[PLATFORM
NAME\]. Every table, column, data type, relationship, and index is
specified here. This document serves as the authoritative reference for
backend engineers building the data layer and the migration scripts that
create it.

The schema is designed for PostgreSQL 15+ with Row-Level Security (RLS)
enforcement as defined in Document 3 (Multi-Tenant Architecture). Every
tenant-scoped table includes a tenant_id column and has RLS policies
applied.

**1.1 Naming Conventions**

  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Convention**   **Rule**                          **Example**
  ---------------- --------------------------------- -----------------------------
  Table names      snake_case, plural nouns          projects, change_orders,
                                                     inspection_results

  Column names     snake_case                        tenant_id, created_at,
                                                     contract_value

  Primary keys     id --- UUID v4 always             id UUID DEFAULT
                                                     gen_random_uuid()

  Foreign keys     {referenced_table_singular}\_id   project_id, tenant_id,
                                                     user_id

  Timestamps       created_at and updated_at on      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT
                   every table                       NOW()

  Soft deletes     deleted_at TIMESTAMPTZ (NULL =    WHERE deleted_at IS NULL in
                   active)                           all queries

  Boolean flags    Prefix: is\_ or has\_             is_active, is_archived,
                                                     has_retainage

  Status fields    VARCHAR(30) with CHECK constraint status VARCHAR(30) CHECK
                                                     (status IN
                                                     (\'active\',\'closed\'))

  JSONB fields     Used for flexible/sparse data     settings JSONB, custom_fields
                   only                              JSONB, metadata JSONB

  Enum-like values VARCHAR with CHECK constraint     Avoids migration pain when
                   (not PG ENUM type)                adding new values
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**1.2 Universal Columns**

Every table in the schema includes these columns unless explicitly
noted:

  ------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**   **Type**                     **Purpose**
  ------------ ---------------------------- ------------------------------
  id           UUID NOT NULL DEFAULT        Unique identifier --- UUID v4,
               gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY    never sequential integer
               KEY                          

  tenant_id    UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES     Tenant isolation --- present
               tenants(id)                  on every tenant-scoped table

  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT Record creation timestamp
               NOW()                        

  updated_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT Last modification timestamp
               NOW()                        --- updated via trigger

  deleted_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NULL             Soft delete --- NULL means
                                            active; timestamp means
                                            deleted
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------

**1.3 Schema Domain Map**

The schema is organized into 10 functional domains. Each domain groups
related tables:

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Domain**      **Tables**                 **Description**
  --------------- -------------------------- ---------------------------------
  Platform        tenants, subscriptions,    Multi-tenant foundation ---
                  feature_flags              company accounts and billing

  Identity        users, user_roles,         Authentication, roles, and access
                  user_invitations, sessions control

  Company         company_employees,         Company-level resources and
                  equipment, vendors,        relationships
                  subcontractors,            
                  certifications             

  Project         projects,                  Project setup, team, and
                  project_team_members,      financial structure
                  project_budgets,           
                  budget_line_items          

  Scheduling      schedule_tasks,            Gantt chart, critical path, and
                  task_dependencies,         timeline data
                  milestones, weather_delays 

  Financial       change_orders, invoices,   All money movement and legal
                  payments, lien_waivers,    financial records
                  preliminary_notices,       
                  draw_schedules             

  Documents       documents,                 File management, plan sets, and
                  document_versions,         media
                  plan_sets, plan_revisions, 
                  photos, photo_albums       

  Field Ops       daily_reports,             Field data capture and quality
                  daily_report_crew,         control
                  inspections,               
                  inspection_results,        
                  punch_list_items,          
                  time_entries               

  Communication   rfis, rfi_responses,       Project communication and
                  submittals,                approval workflows
                  submittal_reviews,         
                  messages, notifications    

  Trade Modules   trade_phases, trade_tasks, Trade-specific data models per
                  trade_inspections,         discipline
                  electrical_panels,         
                  plumbing_fixtures,         
                  hvac_equipment,            
                  concrete_pours, (etc.)     
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

**2. Platform Domain**

**2.1 tenants**

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**                   **Type**       **Nullable**   **Description**
  ---------------------------- -------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE: tenants**                                         

  **id**                       UUID           NOT NULL       Primary key --- tenant identifier
                                                             used in all tenant_id FK columns

  **name**                     VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       Company legal name

  **slug**                     VARCHAR(100)   NOT NULL       URL-safe company identifier (e.g.
                                              UNIQUE         \'abc-general-contractors\')

  **trade_type**               VARCHAR(50)    NOT NULL       Primary trade: gc \| electrical \|
                                                             plumbing \| hvac \| concrete \|
                                                             framing \| roofing \| painting \|
                                                             landscaping \| specialty

  **subscription_tier**        VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       starter \| professional \| business
                                                             \| enterprise

  **subscription_status**      VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       trialing \| active \| past_due \|
                                                             suspended \| cancelled \| purged

  **stripe_customer_id**       VARCHAR(100)   NULL           Stripe customer object ID

  **stripe_subscription_id**   VARCHAR(100)   NULL           Active Stripe subscription ID

  **trial_ends_at**            TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Trial expiration --- NULL if not on
                                                             trial

  **cancelled_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Cancellation timestamp --- starts
                                                             30-day data retention window

  **purge_at**                 TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Scheduled purge date --- set to
                                                             cancelled_at + 30 days

  **settings**                 JSONB          NOT NULL       Tenant config: branding, module
                                              DEFAULT \'{}\' flags, integration tokens, custom
                                                             fields

  **is_active**                BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       Soft-disable flag for
                                              DEFAULT true   suspended/cancelled tenants

  **created_at**               TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       Tenant creation (signup) timestamp

  **updated_at**               TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       Last settings or status change
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**2.2 subscriptions**

  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**                 **Type**      **Nullable**   **Description**
  -------------------------- ------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE: subscriptions**                                

  **id**                     UUID          NOT NULL       Primary key

  **tenant_id**              UUID          NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id)

  **tier**                   VARCHAR(20)   NOT NULL       starter \| professional \| business
                                                          \| enterprise

  **billing_cycle**          VARCHAR(10)   NOT NULL       monthly \| annual

  **base_price_cents**       INTEGER       NOT NULL       Base subscription price in cents

  **current_period_start**   TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       Current billing period start

  **current_period_end**     TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       Current billing period end

  **status**                 VARCHAR(20)   NOT NULL       active \| past_due \| cancelled \|
                                                          paused

  **addon_modules**          JSONB         NOT NULL       Array of active add-on module keys
                                           DEFAULT        and their prices
                                           \'\[\]\'       

  **addon_seats**            INTEGER       NOT NULL       Additional user seats purchased
                                           DEFAULT 0      beyond tier limit

  **created_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       

  **updated_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**2.3 feature_flags**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**        **Type**       **Nullable**   **Description**
  ----------------- -------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE:                                        
  feature_flags**                                 

  **id**            UUID           NOT NULL       Primary key

  **tenant_id**     UUID           NULL           FK -\> tenants(id) --- NULL means
                                                  platform-wide flag

  **flag_key**      VARCHAR(100)   NOT NULL       Feature identifier:
                                                  cross_tenant_collaboration \|
                                                  aia_billing \| lien_management \|
                                                  etc.

  **is_enabled**    BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       Whether the feature is active
                                   DEFAULT false  

  **enabled_at**    TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           When the flag was enabled

  **enabled_by**    UUID           NULL           Super admin user who enabled it

  **metadata**      JSONB          NULL           Optional configuration for the flag

  **created_at**    TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**3. Identity Domain**

**3.1 users**

  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**               **Type**       **Nullable**   **Description**
  ------------------------ -------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE: users**                                       

  **id**                   UUID           NOT NULL       Primary key

  **tenant_id**            UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id) --- user belongs
                                                         to exactly one tenant

  **email**                VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       Login email --- unique within
                                                         tenant scope

  **password_hash**        VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       bcrypt hash (cost 12+) --- never
                                                         plain text

  **first_name**           VARCHAR(100)   NOT NULL       

  **last_name**            VARCHAR(100)   NOT NULL       

  **phone**                VARCHAR(20)    NULL           Mobile number for SMS notifications

  **role**                 VARCHAR(50)    NOT NULL       owner \| project_manager \|
                                                         estimator \| foreman \| field_tech
                                                         \| subcontractor \| client \|
                                                         accountant \| safety_officer

  **is_mfa_enabled**       BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       Whether user has MFA configured
                                          DEFAULT false  

  **mfa_secret**           VARCHAR(255)   NULL           Encrypted TOTP secret

  **avatar_url**           TEXT           NULL           Profile photo URL (pre-signed path
                                                         in object storage)

  **last_login_at**        TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Last successful authentication

  **is_active**            BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       Deactivated users cannot log in but
                                          DEFAULT true   data is preserved

  **notification_prefs**   JSONB          NOT NULL       Per-user notification preferences:
                                          DEFAULT \'{}\' email, SMS, push toggles per event
                                                         type

  **created_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       

  **updated_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       

  **deleted_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Soft delete
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**3.2 user_invitations**

  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**               **Type**       **Nullable**   **Description**
  ------------------------ -------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE:                                               
  user_invitations**                                     

  **id**                   UUID           NOT NULL       Primary key

  **tenant_id**            UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id)

  **invited_by_user_id**   UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> users(id) --- who sent the
                                                         invite

  **email**                VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       Invitee email address

  **role**                 VARCHAR(50)    NOT NULL       Role to assign on acceptance

  **token**                VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       Secure random token --- included in
                                          UNIQUE         invite link

  **expires_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       Invite expiry --- 7 days from
                                                         creation

  **accepted_at**          TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           When the invite was accepted ---
                                                         NULL if pending

  **created_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**3.3 sessions (token revocation)**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**        **Type**       **Nullable**   **Description**
  ----------------- -------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE:                                        
  sessions**                                      

  **id**            UUID           NOT NULL       Primary key

  **user_id**       UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> users(id)

  **tenant_id**     UUID           NOT NULL       Denormalized for fast lookup

  **jti**           VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       JWT ID --- used for revocation
                                   UNIQUE         check on every request

  **device_type**   VARCHAR(20)    NULL           web \| ios \| android

  **ip_address**    INET           NULL           Login IP for audit purposes

  **user_agent**    TEXT           NULL           Browser/device user agent

  **expires_at**    TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       Token expiry

  **revoked_at**    TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           NULL = valid; timestamp = revoked
                                                  (logout, security event)

  **created_at**    TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

