  **name**                   VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL       Project / job name

  **job_number**             VARCHAR(100)   NULL           Internal job number --- unique
                                                           within tenant

  **job_type**               VARCHAR(30)    NOT NULL       self_perform_prime \| gc_with_subs
                                                           \| trade_prime \| subcontract_work
                                                           \| mixed

