                                                           residential_remodel \|
                                                           commercial_new \| commercial_ti \|
                                                           service_repair \| pole_barn \|
                                                           other

  **status**                 VARCHAR(30)    NOT NULL       setup \| active \| on_hold \|
                                            DEFAULT        completed \| cancelled
                                            \'setup\'      

  **client_id**              UUID           NULL           FK -\> clients(id)

  **site_address**           JSONB          NOT NULL       {street, city, state, zip, lat,
                                                           lng, apn}

  **contract_type**          VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       fixed_price \| time_and_materials
                                                           \| cost_plus \| gmp

  **contract_value_cents**   BIGINT         NULL           Original contract value in cents

  **retainage_pct**          DECIMAL(5,2)   NOT NULL       Retainage percentage (e.g. 10.00 =
                                            DEFAULT 10.00  10%)

  **start_date**             DATE           NULL           Planned project start

  **end_date**               DATE           NULL           Planned project completion

  **actual_start_date**      DATE           NULL           Actual start date

  **actual_end_date**        DATE           NULL           Actual completion date

  **active_trade_modules**   JSONB          NOT NULL       Array of trade module keys active
                                            DEFAULT        on this project
                                            \'\[\]\'       

  **description**            TEXT           NULL           Project description / scope summary

  **custom_fields**          JSONB          NOT NULL       Tenant-defined custom field values
                                            DEFAULT \'{}\' 

  **created_by_user_id**     UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> users(id)

  **created_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       

  **updated_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       

  **deleted_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL           Soft delete
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

