**6. Scheduling Domain**

**6.1 schedule_tasks**

  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**                  **Type**       **Nullable**      **Description**
  --------------------------- -------------- ----------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE: schedule_tasks**                                    

  **id**                      UUID           NOT NULL          Primary key

  **tenant_id**               UUID           NOT NULL          FK -\> tenants(id)

  **project_id**              UUID           NOT NULL          FK -\> projects(id)

  **parent_task_id**          UUID           NULL              FK -\> schedule_tasks(id) --- for
                                                               nested/summary tasks

  **name**                    VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL          Task name

  **trade_module**            VARCHAR(50)    NULL              Associated trade module key

  **phase**                   VARCHAR(100)   NULL              Phase within trade module (e.g.
                                                               \'rough_in\', \'trim\')

  **assigned_to_user_id**     UUID           NULL              FK -\> users(id)

  **assigned_to_vendor_id**   UUID           NULL              FK -\> vendors(id) --- if assigned
                                                               to sub

  **planned_start**           DATE           NULL              

  **planned_end**             DATE           NULL              

  **actual_start**            DATE           NULL              

  **actual_end**              DATE           NULL              

  **baseline_start**          DATE           NULL              Original baseline start --- set
                                                               when schedule is baselined

  **baseline_end**            DATE           NULL              Original baseline end

  **duration_days**           INTEGER        NULL              Planned duration in working days

  **percent_complete**        DECIMAL(5,2)   NOT NULL DEFAULT  0.00 to 100.00
                                             0.00              

  **is_milestone**            BOOLEAN        NOT NULL DEFAULT  Milestone tasks have zero duration
                                             false             

  **is_critical_path**        BOOLEAN        NOT NULL DEFAULT  Computed --- true if on critical
                                             false             path

  **show_in_client_portal**   BOOLEAN        NOT NULL DEFAULT  Whether milestone is visible to
                                             false             client

  **status**                  VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL DEFAULT  not_started \| in_progress \|
                                             \'not_started\'   completed \| delayed \| blocked

  **notes**                   TEXT           NULL              

  **sort_order**              INTEGER        NOT NULL DEFAULT  Display order in Gantt
                                             0                 

  **created_at**              TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL          

  **updated_at**              TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL          
