                                                DEFAULT 0      

  **retainage_held_cents**       BIGINT         NOT NULL       Retainage withheld this period
                                                DEFAULT 0      

  **retainage_released_cents**   BIGINT         NOT NULL       Retainage released this period
                                                DEFAULT 0      

  **tax_cents**                  BIGINT         NOT NULL       
                                                DEFAULT 0      

  **total_cents**                BIGINT         NOT NULL       Net amount due after retainage and
                                                DEFAULT 0      tax

  **status**                     VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       draft \| submitted \| approved \|
                                                DEFAULT        paid \| void
                                                \'draft\'      

