**11. Trade Module Domain**

Trade module tables store discipline-specific data for each trade. All
tables follow the universal schema conventions and include tenant_id for
RLS enforcement. Only the v1.0 trade modules (General Contracting,
Electrical, Plumbing) are fully specified here. Additional trade module
tables follow the same patterns.

**11.1 trade_phases (shared across all modules)**

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**         **Type**       **Nullable**      **Description**
  ------------------ -------------- ----------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE:                                            
  trade_phases**                                      

  **id**             UUID           NOT NULL          Primary key

  **tenant_id**      UUID           NOT NULL          FK -\> tenants(id)

  **project_id**     UUID           NOT NULL          FK -\> projects(id)

  **trade_module**   VARCHAR(50)    NOT NULL          electrical \| plumbing \| hvac \|
                                                      concrete \| framing \| gc \| etc.

  **phase_key**      VARCHAR(50)    NOT NULL          rough_in \| trim \| final \|
                                                      underground \| equipment_set \|
                                                      etc.

  **phase_name**     VARCHAR(100)   NOT NULL          Display name

  **status**         VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL DEFAULT  not_started \| in_progress \|
                                    \'not_started\'   completed \| failed \| skipped

  **started_at**     TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL              

  **completed_at**   TIMESTAMPTZ    NULL              

  **sort_order**     INTEGER        NOT NULL DEFAULT  Phase sequence
                                    0                 

  **notes**          TEXT           NULL              

  **created_at**     TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL          

  **updated_at**     TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL          
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

