  **phases**                 INTEGER        NULL           1 \| 3

  **total_breakers**         INTEGER        NULL           

  **is_main_service**        BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       
                                            DEFAULT false  

  **utility_meter_number**   VARCHAR(100)   NULL           

  **status**                 VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       rough \| trimmed \| energized \|
                                            DEFAULT        final
                                            \'rough\'      

  **notes**                  TEXT           NULL           

  **created_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ    NOT NULL       

