  **panel_id**            UUID           NOT NULL          FK -\> electrical_panels(id)

  **circuit_number**      VARCHAR(10)    NOT NULL          Breaker position(s) (e.g. \'1\',
                                                           \'3-5\')

  **description**         VARCHAR(255)   NOT NULL          What this circuit serves

