  **tenant_id**               UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id)

  **project_id**              UUID           NOT NULL       FK -\> projects(id)

  **system**                  VARCHAR(30)    NOT NULL       water \| gas \| drain_waste_vent \|
                                                            air

  **test_type**               VARCHAR(30)    NOT NULL       hydrostatic \| air_pressure \|
                                                            visual

  **test_pressure_psi**       DECIMAL(6,2)   NULL           Applied test pressure

  **test_duration_minutes**   INTEGER        NULL           

  **tested_at**               DATE           NOT NULL       

  **technician_name**         VARCHAR(200)   NULL           

  **inspector_present**       BOOLEAN        NOT NULL       
                                             DEFAULT false  

  **result**                  VARCHAR(20)    NOT NULL       pass \| fail

  **failure_notes**           TEXT           NULL           Description of leaks or failures if
