**11.4 Cross-Tenant Collaboration Tables (v1.1)**

> **v1.1 Tables:**
>
> The following tables are designed now but not activated until v1.1.
> The schema is defined here so v1.0 migrations do not conflict with
> v1.1 additions.

**tenant_connections**

  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Column**                 **Type**      **Nullable**   **Description**
  -------------------------- ------------- -------------- -----------------------------------
  **TABLE:                                                
  tenant_connections**                                    

  **id**                     UUID          NOT NULL       Primary key

  **initiating_tenant_id**   UUID          NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id) --- the inviting
                                                          GC or prime contractor

  **receiving_tenant_id**    UUID          NOT NULL       FK -\> tenants(id) --- the invited
                                                          sub or specialty contractor

  **project_id**             UUID          NOT NULL       FK -\> projects(id) --- specific
                                                          project being shared

  **scope_description**      TEXT          NULL           Description of awarded scope

  **contract_value_cents**   BIGINT        NULL           Awarded contract value

  **permissions**            JSONB         NOT NULL       Governs which data types cross the
                                           DEFAULT \'{}\' tenant boundary

  **status**                 VARCHAR(20)   NOT NULL       pending \| active \| completed \|
                                           DEFAULT        disconnected \| rejected
                                           \'pending\'    

  **initiated_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       
                                           DEFAULT NOW()  

  **accepted_at**            TIMESTAMPTZ   NULL           

  **completed_at**           TIMESTAMPTZ   NULL           

  **created_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       

  **updated_at**             TIMESTAMPTZ   NOT NULL       
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**12. Index Strategy**

All performance-critical indexes are listed here. Every tenant-scoped
table uses tenant_id as the leading index column. Secondary indexes
support the most common query patterns.

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Table**             **Index Columns**       **Type**   **Purpose**
  --------------------- ----------------------- ---------- -------------------------
  tenants               slug                    UNIQUE     Tenant lookup by URL slug

  tenants               stripe_customer_id      BTREE      Stripe webhook lookups

  users                 tenant_id, email        UNIQUE     Login lookup --- email
                                                           unique per tenant

  users                 tenant_id, role         BTREE      Role-based user listing

  sessions              jti                     UNIQUE     Token revocation check
                                                           --- must be
                                                           sub-millisecond

  sessions              user_id, revoked_at     BTREE      Active sessions per user

  projects              tenant_id               BTREE      All projects for a tenant

  projects              tenant_id, status       BTREE      Active/completed project
                                                           filtering

  projects              tenant_id, client_id    BTREE      Projects by client

  budget_line_items     tenant_id, project_id   BTREE      Budget per project

  schedule_tasks        tenant_id, project_id   BTREE      All tasks per project

  schedule_tasks        tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Critical path filter
                        is_critical_path                   

  task_dependencies     predecessor_task_id     BTREE      Dependency graph
                                                           traversal

  task_dependencies     successor_task_id       BTREE      Reverse dependency lookup

  change_orders         tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Open COs per project
                        status                             

  invoices              tenant_id, project_id   BTREE      Invoices per project

  invoices              quickbooks_invoice_id   BTREE      QBO sync lookups

  documents             tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Documents by type per
                        document_type                      project

  photos                tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Client portal photo feed
                        is_client_visible                  

  daily_reports         tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Daily reports by date
                        report_date                        

  time_entries          tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Time per employee per
                        employee_id                        project

  inspections           tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Inspections by trade
                        trade_module                       

  rfis                  tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Open RFIs per project
                        status                             

  notifications         tenant_id, user_id,     BTREE      Unread notifications per
                        is_read                            user

  trade_phases          tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Phase status per trade
                        trade_module                       per project

  electrical_panels     tenant_id, project_id   BTREE      Panels per project

  electrical_circuits   tenant_id, project_id,  BTREE      Circuits per panel
                        panel_id                           
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

